<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Description">Description</span></h2>
<p>Enables or disables equipment access for a particular party member.
</p><p>NOTE: This command will not work in <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/EVENT%20TYPE%20AREALOAD%20PRELOADEXIT" title="EVENT TYPE AREALOAD PRELOADEXIT">EVENT_TYPE_AREALOAD_PRELOADEXIT</a>.
</p>
